    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">The number of completed, country-specific Biodiversity Finance Plans (BFPs) that (i) follow the validation of a country-specific Policy and Institutional Review (PIR), Biodiversity Expenditure Review (BER), and Finance Needs Assessment (FNA) AND (ii) contain analysis that has been validated by the country programme&apos;s national steering committee.</narrative>
    </description>
